@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Customer
actor Agent
participant "Angular App" as UI
participant "Ocelot Gateway" as GW
participant "PolicyBillingService" as PB
participant "QuoteRatingService" as QR
participant "UnderwritingService" as UW

Customer -> UI : Request eligible renewal
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/policies/{policyId}/renew
GW -> PB : Validate 30-day renewal window
PB --> GW : Renewal record
GW --> UI : Renewal requested

Agent -> UI : Open renewal request
UI -> GW : GET /policies/api/renewals/{renewalId}
GW -> PB : Read renewal progress
PB --> GW : Derived renewal status
GW --> UI : Renewal progress

Agent -> UI : Start renewal quote
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/renewals/{renewalId}/start-quote
GW -> PB : Authorize assigned agent
PB -> QR : Start normal renewal Quote
QR --> PB : Quote reference
PB --> GW : Quote started
GW --> UI : Quote workflow

QR -> UW : Submit finalized renewal Quote
UW --> QR : Underwriting application
QR --> UI : Underwriting state (through normal API path)

Customer -> UI : Accept approved renewal + first payment
UI -> GW : Normal policy purchase APIs
GW -> PB : Validate approved renewal + exact predecessor expiry date
PB -> UW : Validate approved renewal offer
UW --> PB : Valid
PB --> GW : New policy issued
GW --> UI : Renewal completed / new policy
@enduml
